attack_lines = Array[String](["I like to think I have a bit of a flare about me.", "You should probably stop, drop, and roll.", "I hope you brought some marshmallows, heh heh.", "Can you say ouch...?", "I do hope you wore sunscreen.", "Heh... I just sparkle, don't I?", "I hope you're um... cold blooded.", "Oh look, a crispy critter...!", "It's going to get rather... warm around here.", "Hot, hot and hotter...!", "You're outta here, I think.", "This should take the chill out of the air...!"])
